        "payload": "tree bbf12d01c9e6b37a216fb04ac51eb6588dc43203\nparent a773e1e33b349dc819b5a0edc1c7a4839dc73b48\nauthor Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1792792311 +0200\ncommitter Ferdinando Ametrano <ferdinando@ametrano.net> 1792792311 +0200\n\nkernel: document that process_block stores unrequested blocks\n\nbtck_chainstate_manager_process_block processes every block as\nrequested. Validation therefore does not skip a block that has less\nwork than the tip, is more than 288 blocks ahead of it, is below the\nminimum chain work, or was pruned before. bitcoind skips such blocks\nwhen it did not ask for them.\n\nThe API does not say so. Document that a caller taking blocks from\nuntrusted sources has to apply these checks itself.\n",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRJ5SMZs3eEinN+Lb4iedqLwmlHIAUCatvW9xsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQInnai8JpRyBRmgD+OCGU1mdk5WGV8WgxqtBs\nniV3tffERbyTgH2WIuMEDvMBAKhN6JXLn9dCWPTOInYjWXl+n0Jm9Ee3ZGSiyKxa\nEUEI\n=YxnQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----"
